From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: H96 series reconstruction <builder@h96-build>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:21:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 43/59] arm64: dts: rockchip: h96-max-v58: DDR floor margin for
 1440p60

The 900 MB/s mid-high threshold sat just above the 1440p60 frame
bandwidth (884 MB/s); only the line figure (909 MB/s, CVT-RB timing)
cleared it, and AFBC scanout halves both, so 4K60 with AFBC (995 MB/s)
had 10 % margin. Lower the mid-high threshold to 800 MB/s in both
tables: 1440p60 linear clears it by 10 %, AFBC 4K60 by 24 %, 1080p60
linear (497 MB/s) keeps the full range down to 528 MHz.

AFBC 1440p60 (442 MB/s) stays without a floor: it cannot be told
apart from a linear 1080p60 desktop by bandwidth. Comment states the
covered and uncovered cases.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P6itje71iKPFBX7YKkfvRo
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-h96-max-v58.dts | 10 +++++++---
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-h96-max-v58.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-h96-max-v58.dts
index 4db8a6d60..dd7418a7c 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-h96-max-v58.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-h96-max-v58.dts
@@ -530,15 +530,19 @@ &vop {
 /* DDR DVFS (dfi + dmc okay from rk3588-android.dtsi); loader rate held for 30 s after probe */
 &dmc {
 	delayed-freq-scaling;
-	/* scanout floor in MB/s: 1440p60, 1080p144, 4K60 and up get mid-high, two full 4K60 planes get high */
+	/*
+	 * scanout floor in MB/s, linear ARGB8888 (AFBC halves): 1440p60 884,
+	 * 1080p144 1194, 4K60 1990 get mid-high; 1080p60 497 keeps the full
+	 * range; AFBC 4K60 995 stays mid-high, AFBC 1440p60 442 gets none
+	 */
 	vop-bw-dmc-level = <
 		/* min	max	level */
-		900	2999	DMC_FREQ_LEVEL_MID_HIGH
+		800	2999	DMC_FREQ_LEVEL_MID_HIGH
 		3000	99999	DMC_FREQ_LEVEL_HIGH
 	>;
 	vop-frame-bw-dmc-level = <
 		/* min	max	level */
-		900	2999	DMC_FREQ_LEVEL_MID_HIGH
+		800	2999	DMC_FREQ_LEVEL_MID_HIGH
 		3000	99999	DMC_FREQ_LEVEL_HIGH
 	>;
 };
